olutionaries against each other to  pit progressives against each other  knowing full well that there's no  iteration of protest that any of us can  do I don't care if you're black if  you're white if you're protesting  political power then there's no way that  you could protest and have it approved  by those people in power power will  never approve of your protest it doesn't  matter if you kneel it doesn't matter if  you sit quietly as in a sit-in it  doesn't matter if you are quiet in class  and you silent and refuse to speak it  doesn't matter if you're marching in the  streets it doesn't matter if you're  standing in front of a building there's  no way that you can protest that will  ever be approved of by the system and no  matter how they like to throw people  from the past into the mix to say oh  this is how dr. King would do it or this  is how Muhammad Ali would do it the fact  of the matter is is that they would have  opposed them during their time the same  way they opposed Colin Kaepernick right  now
 

